---
const modelSelectionPath = '/models'
---

<html lang="zh-Hant">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${modelSelectionPath}`} />
    <title>選擇 CAD 模型 | replicad-web-cad</title>
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace('/models')
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>請先選擇 CAD 模型</h1>
      <p>CAD workspace 需要指定模型後才能開啟。</p>
      <a href={modelSelectionPath}>返回模型選擇 →</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
